# Unit Testing Rules

- Write tests in the same phase as the feature; green tests are part of DoD
- Run: `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`
- Domain (`GameEngine`, `Rules`) — highest priority, pure JVM, fixed deck seed
- Flow/tick: `runTest` + Turbine for `observeState`
- ViewModel: inject fake `GameClient` / `ProfileRepository`, no Android framework
- Phase 5+: MockWebServer for Retrofit, not live API
- See `docs/architecture/testing.md` for required scenarios per phase

```kotlin
@Test
fun addCard_rejects_whenRankNotOnTable() = runTest {
    val engine = GameEngine(seed = 42)
    // ...
}
```
